# direnv configuration (house convention - see sibling blink repos)
# Loads env from .env files and enters the nix flake dev shell on cd;
# run `direnv allow` once per machine.
# Supported variables: see .env.example (root) and apps/api/.env.example
# (backend) - the templates are the registry, this file only loads them.

dotenv_if_exists .env
dotenv_if_exists .env.local

use flake

# Workspace bins (tsx, knex, biome, jest, vitest, eslint, ...) on PATH
PATH_add node_modules/.bin
